'''Papa Dragoste''' is a [[Sim]] featured in the reveal trailer for ''[[The Sims 4: Life & Death]]''. He is available for download from the [[The Sims 4 Gallery|Gallery]] by Maxis,<ref>[https://www.ea.com/games/the-sims/the-sims-4/gallery/item/KXMacIuGQ32W96ptWhGKDw Dragoste by Maxis]</ref> along with his three children, [[Angelika Dragoste|Angelika]], [[Travis Dragoste|Travis]], and [[Liv Dragoste|Liv]], his son-in-law, [[Paul Dragoste|Paul]], and his two granddaughters, [[Justine Dragoste|Justine]] and [[Robin Dragoste|Robin]].

While the family bio states he is close to dying, he is actually quite close to the beginning of the [[Elder]] stage, having lived 118 days. Strangely enough, he has two Aspiration traits: Domestic, which makes sense considering his [[Aspiration (The Sims 4)|Aspiration]], and Quick Learner, which is normally associated with Knowledge Aspirations.

Papa has no job, likely making him retired.

