==Trivia==
*He and [[Chantrelle Riffin]] are the only [[child]] [[Sim]]s with a [[skill]] mastered.
*Loki is one of the 2 people in the [[Beaker family|entire family]] who do not have the [[Aspiration (The Sims 2)|aspiration]] of [[Romance (aspiration)|Romance]] or [[Fortune]], but rather have the aspiration of [[Knowledge]].
*Loki's facial features almost exactly resemble those shown in famous displays of the [[wikipedia:Loki|mythological Loki]]. His Beta version was shown close to release; however, seems to more closely reference the appearance of [[wikipedia:Igor and Grichka Bogdanoff|Igor and Grichka Bogdanoff]], who were famous scientists and TV [[personality|personalities]], and also known for their heavily altered features.

